    "description": "The Hold Hotel Rooms API enables businesses to temporarily secure hotel room reservations for customers. It streamlines the booking process by allowing users to place holds on selected rooms without immediate payment. This is particularly useful for travel agents and customers looking to finalize their travel plans, ensuring they have access to desired accommodations. Key features include specifying room types, dates, and customer details, enhancing the user experience in the hospitality sector.",
